From: SiliconLoop closed-loop development
Subject: [PATCH 0016] ai-agent: request-tree hardening and alloc guards

Incremental on 0015. tree checks + allocation-failure instrumentation
for the request assembly path; message-name fixes for strict API
validators; ownership-safe tools cache and message attach.

